<body>
    <h1>Deployment</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 local-id=3D"c6181d6a4859" id=3D"Deployment-PowerBIRepo:"><stron=
g>Power BI Repo:</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"8f709ebc7aec"><a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearanc=
e=3D"inline" href=3D"https://dev.azure.com/WRB-CRMIntegration/WRB-%20CRM%20=
Integration/_git/WRB%20-%20PowerBi" local-id=3D"7a04707a9180" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">https://dev.azure.com/WRB-CRMIntegration/WRB-%20CRM%20Integration/_git/=
WRB%20-%20PowerBi</a></p>
<ul local-id=3D"1656ae885786">
<li local-id=3D"0bd8690774e4">
<p local-id=3D"8a9656129e2e">All report/dataset modifications must start in=
 the WRB-Dynamics Dev workspace</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"5d026a16ccdb">
<p local-id=3D"bf8ea99a11f7">All report/dataset modifications need to be pu=
shed to the Dev branch in the PowerBI Repo after PR Approval</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"ca31aa46e871" id=3D"Deployment-DeploymentPipelines:">Deploy=
ment Pipelines:</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"f21b47b6e127" id=3D"Deployment-Link:https://app.powerbi.com=
/pipelines/696780bb-616d-4bc2-8c78-6fd578e9dbe9?experience=3Dpower-bi">Link=
: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://app.powerbi.com/pipelines/6967=
80bb-616d-4bc2-8c78-6fd578e9dbe9?experience=3Dpower-bi" rel=3D"nofollow">ht=
tps://app.powerbi.com/pipelines/696780bb-616d-4bc2-8c78-6fd578e9dbe9?experi=
ence=3Dpower-bi</a></h4>
<p local-id=3D"c971a82e6a1c">When you're working in a deployment pipeline, =
different stages might have different configurations. For example, each sta=
ge can have different databases or different query parameters. The developm=
ent stage might query sample data from the database, while the test and pro=
duction stages query the entire database.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20261104-140406.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"135afd19523a6e6afcf2b5fe3621e2388da985ae17a64c24f8e7e08bf9d63975" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2265=
153937/image-20261104-140406.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1793801=
048171&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"277" data-width=3D=
"1167" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"22673=
16755" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"atta=
chment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20261104-140406.png" da=
ta-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-c=
ontent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2265153937" =
data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" data-media-id=3D"f1bcf36c-c6b4=
-49e8-9b21-c84df8b7a992" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"111"></span>
<p local-id=3D"d9dc3db18a6c"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"27afe925b73f" id=3D"Deployment-ManageDeployments:">Manage D=
eployments:</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"f18a9d80df87">
<li local-id=3D"e130ce8b5818">
<ul local-id=3D"db78d40d4109">
<li local-id=3D"a732a3c2-ef23-4a7b-842d-44fabff703cd">
<p local-id=3D"84de22999c35">The deployment pipeline is configured with the=
 promotion path <strong>Development =E2=86=92 UAT =E2=86=92 Production</str=
ong>, ensuring controlled movement of solutions through each environment.</=
p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"8ebec3b0-02b0-4e32-9e7d-0fe857442ac6">
<p local-id=3D"2c7c5fef9d57">Each deployment stage has <strong>Deployment R=
ules</strong> configured to automatically map environment-specific connecti=
on references, connection strings, and configuration values to the correspo=
nding workspace environment during deployment.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b4046473-3d67-4b48-92c5-30804c5e0196">
<p local-id=3D"86f1e662365b">Deployment rules eliminate the need for manual=
 updates after deployment and help ensure that reports/datasets in <strong>=
DEV, UAT, and Production</strong> connect to the appropriate data sources a=
nd services for each environment.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"7deaaa07-b5d0-4edf-9c93-392ae29d138b">
<p local-id=3D"0ee80d47e304">All deployments should be promoted through the=
 pipeline to maintain consistency, governance, and traceability across envi=
ronments.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"a305f93ef596" id=3D"Deployment-ConfigureDeploymentRules">Co=
nfigure Deployment Rules</h3>
<p local-id=3D"b8cfb8751d2f">To create a deployment rule, follow the steps =
in this section. After you create all the deployment rules you need, deploy=
 the semantic models with the newly created rules from the source stage to =
the target stage where the rules were created. Your rules don't apply until=
 you deploy the semantic models from the source to the target stage.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20261105-143229.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"1f2a6c1c2438fe463aabbfa88ad4ec7d5bece75361cafe6e0a213f85b61b7015" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2265=
153937/image-20261105-143229.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1793889=
151394&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"246" data-width=3D=
"452" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"226816=
8599" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20261105-143229.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2265153937" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" data-media-id=3D"af820fc5-cba6-=
4b18-8ee0-f4c2f3bc3b2b" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"254"></span>
<p local-id=3D"d1174253f4af"><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrappe=
r image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confl=
uence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20261105-143135.png" width=
=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"864ced15550b17e84b72c9cdd60e4f199df0ca3787=
f3bbcee3ca4752ac95e00b" data-image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/w=
iki/download/attachments/2265153937/image-20261105-143135.png?version=3D1&a=
mp;modificationDate=3D1793889097313&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data=
-height=3D"530" data-width=3D"1203" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" dat=
a-linked-resource-id=3D"2268267248" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data=
-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"=
image-20261105-143135.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net=
/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource=
-container-id=3D"2265153937" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" d=
ata-media-id=3D"a9a5faca-304d-469d-b0b3-724af59cfb44" data-media-type=3D"fi=
le" height=3D"206"></span></p>
<p local-id=3D"48b7b370de91"><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrappe=
r image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confl=
uence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20261105-141608.png" width=
=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"d52a7ac7946e2e1dcc844e3e18af82292730462b07=
bfb12c1c4367c98f6e0c6f" data-image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/w=
iki/download/attachments/2265153937/image-20261105-141608.png?version=3D1&a=
mp;modificationDate=3D1793888170666&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data=
-height=3D"660" data-width=3D"1216" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" dat=
a-linked-resource-id=3D"2268201320" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data=
-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"=
image-20261105-141608.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net=
/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource=
-container-id=3D"2265153937" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" d=
ata-media-id=3D"42845482-c274-403c-b599-afb1134e9737" data-media-type=3D"fi=
le" height=3D"253"></span></p>
<p local-id=3D"465538e77ee8"></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"f1a0ff06-8212-47ce-a1d1-b251a2e67e28">
<li local-id=3D"5c240107-b764-4ce7-88c3-8afccfed8a6b">
<p local-id=3D"c3057fa97ff2">In the pipeline stage you want to create a dep=
loyment rule for, select <strong>Deployment rules</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"43548737-62fd-4fd5-8488-5430b23398d6">
<p local-id=3D"14344fc4e3c8">A list of items you can set rules for appear i=
n the window. Not all items in the pipeline are listed. Only items of a typ=
e that you can create rules for are listed (dataflows gen1, semantic model,=
 notebooks, and paginated reports). To find the item you want to set a rule=
 for, use the search or filter functionalities.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"fff19b86-0c12-416f-90a9-79e672d4aa58">
<p local-id=3D"8e08c9f9aaf2">Select the item you want to create a rule for.=
 The types of rules you can create for that item are displayed. So, for exa=
mple, if you're creating a rule for a dataflow gen1, you can create a data =
source rule or a parameter rule. If you're creating a rule for a notebook, =
you can create a default lakehouse rule.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"34eee36a-0fbf-4419-91bc-ec66ed95f191">
<p local-id=3D"469539c73fcf">Select the type of rule you want to create, ex=
pand the list, and then select <strong>Add rule</strong>. There are two typ=
es of rules you can create:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"1f65656b82ee">
<li local-id=3D"d660c7bc-f438-4f80-a7b1-2493fb9165e8">
<p local-id=3D"dfc726bd98d6"><strong>Data source rules</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ec883e451b42">From the data source list, select a data sourc=
e name to be updated. Use one of the following methods to select a value to=
 replace the one from the source stage:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"46610c54-2e12-42b5-acbc-e397d829402d">
<li local-id=3D"1aad0a92-7380-403b-8d8c-98f1a3f04f97">
<p local-id=3D"2f0343dd1c56">Select from a list.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"3dca00e9-691d-4ff2-ba18-20041f2d72e0">
<p local-id=3D"5ebcb2c56dbe">Select <em>Other</em> and manually add the new=
 data source. You can only change to a data source from the same type.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"247c3ec0116a">
<p local-id=3D"cbcfe1072d73">Note:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"10474e71-fe6d-4df2-8dfe-0e3ced3ae665">
<li local-id=3D"52ee0b5a-2077-49bb-bafb-d8717110f054">
<p local-id=3D"5b89cf920b1c"><em>Data source rules</em> will be grayed out =
if you're not the owner of the item you're creating a rule for, or if your =
item doesn't contain any data sources.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"f2eaeaa2-cde7-4122-af05-e6d4fb9c40e5">
<p local-id=3D"d8c4b27c2e3f">For <em>dataflows gen1</em>, <em>semantic mode=
ls</em> and <em>paginated reports</em>, the data source list is taken from =
the source pipeline stage.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"83b853e1-4776-420f-8886-516af44d0fd9">
<p local-id=3D"9aaffad38208">You can=E2=80=99t use the same data source in =
more than one rule.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"54c89686-ece1-46c9-ad61-a0dabbc2a2d9">
<p local-id=3D"484bf3b94fe5"><strong>Parameter rules</strong> Select a para=
meter from the list of parameters; the current value is shown. Edit the val=
ue to the value you want to take effect after each deployment.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"ca233616277e"></p>
<p local-id=3D"3daeb2eba2c4"><strong>Deployment: </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6537bb89d08a">Once the report/dataset changes are made in DE=
V, deploy content from one stage to the next.</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"bf46b1d0-c512-457e-bb66-b30c605d8e68">
<li local-id=3D"fbcfabbb-3be0-4653-adc6-21ebe65a67d9">
<p local-id=3D"71a8ee481336">Go to the Deployment Pipeline page and select =
the stage you want to deploy content <strong><u>to</u></strong> (if pushing=
 from development to UAT, select UAT).</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"465ed5a976af">
<p local-id=3D"55f019b128bc">Verify the deployment Rules</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"2389224f6192">
<li local-id=3D"9095d42f0fad">
<p local-id=3D"799b80f37cb8">Make sure the Dataset Rules are pointing to th=
e correct environment URL</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ab10b521234c">
<p local-id=3D"597ff88c1323">Make sure the Parameters are point to the corr=
ect Helix DB Catalog</p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"e1d3d973-255d-4fbc-9d99-998622a0f264">
<p local-id=3D"76266101afc6">Choose the relevant environment.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ed47c753-38e9-4f24-9ed3-f2a8c5bc1db2">
<p local-id=3D"d8e92d6db370">Check the boxes of the items below to push to =
the selected environment.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"62040a90-4d92-4213-b19e-2ec1424623b0">
<p local-id=3D"9e5077d522fd">Select Deploy</p>
</li>
</ol>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20261105-143007.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"1d3cc866b3a8c3d9d88a6f27c1b6c9eff2a4fd91cb6e4b71efef8791af26a3db" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2265=
153937/image-20261105-143007.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1793889=
009550&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"912" data-width=3D=
"1488" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"22682=
67241" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"atta=
chment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20261105-143007.png" da=
ta-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-c=
ontent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2265153937" =
data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" data-media-id=3D"f931de8c-8492=
-4596-aa6a-d613c5bb9faa" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"286"></span>
<p local-id=3D"03e501e013f4">You will be prompted to add a note on the depl=
oyment; this is where all changes can be summarized and viewable in the dep=
loyment history log.</p>
